  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 的模組。用心製作。支援 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的多款活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>沉默生物（Silence Mobs）是一款極簡風格的模組，它新增了用<strong>沉默棒</strong>讓生物沉默的功能。你可以透過 <em>/silencestick</em>（或 <em>/st</em>）指令將一根木棒轉換為沉默棒。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"前置需求\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective 模組\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"運作環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/silence-mobs/a.png\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"853\" height=\"180\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><strong>如何使用？</strong><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/silence-mobs/b.png\" alt=\"沉默棒\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"><br>手持一根木棒時，輸入 <em>/silencestick</em>（或 <em>/st</em>）指令即可獲得<strong>沉默棒</strong>。<br><br></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/silence-mobs/c.png\" alt=\"物品描述\" width=\"401\" height=\"133\"><br><span>多麼美麗的物品啊。<br><br></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/silence-mobs/d.png\" alt=\"羊\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"><br>用它擊中任何生物，該生物便會陷入沉默。顯示「沉默實體」名稱的功能可在設定中切換開關。<br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>也可用於已有名稱的實體：</strong><br></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/silence-mobs/e.webp\" alt=\"切換GIF\" width=\"1000\" height=\"502\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>你可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，前提是下載連結仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若遇到問題、有想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 倉庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
